diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 1a55755..5ecd266 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,7 +6,16 @@ In-memory inventory service. `api.handle(request)` maps a request
 
 ## Endpoints
 
-- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...]}`: every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...], "next_cursor": <string or null>}`: one page
+  of items, ordered by `id`.
+  - `limit` (optional): integer from 1 to 100, default 20.
+  - `cursor` (optional): the `next_cursor` from a previous response. Treat it
+    as opaque and pass it back unchanged. Omit it for the first page.
+  - `next_cursor` is `null` on the last page.
+  - An invalid `limit` or `cursor` → 400 `{"error": "..."}`.
 - `GET /items/<id>` → the item, 404 when unknown, 400 when `id` is not a number.
 
+To read the whole catalogue, request `/items` and keep following
+`next_cursor` until it is `null`.
+
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
